    "agent_last_message": "Implemented in [output/main.py](/workspace/output/main.py).\n\nWhat it does:\n- Parses only `--input <path>` and `--output <path>` (unknown/missing args return exit `1`).\n- Reads input in bytes to count `characters` exactly as bytes.\n- Computes `lines` per spec:\n  - empty file => `0`\n  - otherwise `count('\\n')`, plus 1 only if file does not end in `\\n`.\n- Decodes as UTF-8, splits words using exactly: space, tab, newline, carriage return, form feed, vertical tab.\n- Counts words case-insensitively (`lower()`), computes `unique_words`, and returns top 10 sorted by:\n  - descending count\n  - ascending lexicographic word for ties.\n- Writes JSON output in the required schema.\n- Exit codes:\n  - `0` success\n  - `1` invalid invocation/input unreadable/malformed\n  - `2` unexpected internal error\n\nValidation run:\n- Success case returned `EXIT:0` and produced correct JSON.\n- Missing input file returned `EXIT:1`.\n- Missing required arg returned `EXIT:1`.",
